<title>ROMANIA: TURNOVER LOW, PRICES MIXED ON BUCHAREST BOURSE.</title>
<headline>TURNOVER LOW, PRICES MIXED ON BUCHAREST BOURSE.</headline>
<text>
<p>1315 GMT - Bucharest bourse turnover picked up some 17 million lei from the previous level on Tuesday but remained low at 55.5 million lei in thin investor interest.</p>
<p>* Shares traded mixed in low volumes.</p>
<p>* Azomures SA fertiliser maker dominated trading.  </p>
